# █   █ ▄▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▄ █    █▀▀▄      █▀▀▀ ▄▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▄ ▀▀█▀▀ ▄▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▀
# █ ▄ █ █   █ █▀▀▄ █    █  █      █▀▀  █▀▀█ █  ▄   █   █   █ █▀▀▄  ▀▀▄
#  ▀ ▀   ▀▀▀  ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀       ▀    ▀  ▀  ▀▀    ▀    ▀▀▀  ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀ 
world_tension_factor:
  base(-0.75)
  modifier:
    # `threat` is global-scoped; a bare name is read as a country var and stays 0.
    wt_bonus = 0.75 * global.threat
    add(wt_bonus)
    has_government(democratic | neutrality)
    not has_country_leader_ideology(japan_militarism_ideology)
    is_sandbox_mode_on()
  modifier:
    add(0.75)
    or:
      has_government(communism | fascism)
      has_country_leader_ideology(japan_militarism_ideology)
    is_sandbox_mode_on()
  modifier:
    factor(0)
    is_sandbox_mode_on(no)

# █ █▀▀▄ █▀▀▀ ▄▀▀▀▄ █    ▄▀▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▀  ▀▄ ▄▀      █▀▀▀ ▄▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▄ ▀▀█▀▀ ▄▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▀
# █ █  █ █▀▀  █   █ █    █   █ █  ▀█   █        █▀▀  █▀▀█ █  ▄   █   █   █ █▀▀▄  ▀▀▄
# ▀ ▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀   ▀▀▀    ▀        ▀    ▀  ▀  ▀▀    ▀    ▀▀▀  ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀ 
democracy_factor:
  $ideology_factor(democratic)

monarchy_factor:
  $ideology_factor(neutrality)

communism_factor:
  $ideology_factor(communism)

fascism_factor:
  $ideology_factor(fascism)

# ▀▀█▀▀ ▀▄ ▄▀ █▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▄ █▄  █ █▄  █ ▀▄ ▄▀      █▀▀▀ ▄▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▄ ▀▀█▀▀ ▄▀▀▀▄ █▀▀▄ ▄▀▀▀
#   █     █   █▀▀▄ █▀▀█ █ ▀▄█ █ ▀▄█   █        █▀▀  █▀▀█ █  ▄   █   █   █ █▀▀▄  ▀▀▄
#   ▀     ▀   ▀  ▀ ▀  ▀ ▀   ▀ ▀   ▀   ▀        ▀    ▀  ▀  ▀▀    ▀    ▀▀▀  ▀  ▀ ▀▀▀ 
# Peak at low tyranny (≤ −75), zero at −25 and above
low_tyranny_factor:
  base(0)
  modifier:
    low_tyranny_bonus = clamp((-25 - tyranny) / 50, 0.0, 1.0)
    add(low_tyranny_bonus)
    is_sandbox_mode_on()
  modifier:
    factor(0)
    is_sandbox_mode_on(no)

# Peak at high tyranny (≥ 75), zero at 25 and below
high_tyranny_factor:
  base(0)
  modifier:
    high_tyranny_bonus = clamp((tyranny - 25) / 50, 0.0, 1.0)
    add(high_tyranny_bonus)
    is_sandbox_mode_on()
  modifier:
    factor(0)
    is_sandbox_mode_on(no)

# Peak inside [−25, 25], zero at ±75
medium_tyranny_factor:
  base(0)
  modifier:
    medium_tyranny_bonus = clamp(1 - (abs(tyranny) - 25) / 50, 0.0, 1.0)
    add(medium_tyranny_bonus)
    is_sandbox_mode_on()
  modifier:
    factor(0)
    is_sandbox_mode_on(no)
